    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "學術研究倫理教育",
    "sub_ename": "RESEARCH ETHICS EDUCATION ONLINE PROGRAM",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在培養初踏入研究領域之高等教育學生了解學術倫理重要性，希冀透過課程提升學生之學術倫理思維、普世價值、法律規範等倫理知能，增進對於學術倫理與研究倫理意涵與實務面之理解，並落實誠信且負責任的研究行為。",
    "describe_eh": "The goal of the present curriculum is to instill the importance of academic integrity to studednts in higher education,who have just entered the field of research. Through these lessons, we hope to enhance ethical capabilities of students such as academic integrity resioning, universal values, and laws and regulations. Additionally,we wish to strengthen the understanding of academic integrity,research ethics,and aspects in practice, as well implementing honest and responsible research conducts.",
